title: "SFW AI Roleplay and Conversational Intimacy: A Research-Informed Design Brief"
abstract: >-
  A research-informed design brief, written by the founder of a commercial AI
  character product, on responsiveness, emotional disclosure, memory and
  character design in SFW AI character chat and roleplay. It is not an
  independent study and makes no product-performance claims.
